  "text": "Our study described the level of awareness of CKD complications among non-medical female university students in Riyadh city. Saudi Arabia. The findings demonstrate that our target group has an unsatisfactory level of awareness (51.8%). Although our findings were unsatisfactory, it was higher than two studies both done in Saudi Arabia, one was done in the Hail region [10] and had 43.5% of their participants with adequate knowledge, and another one done in the AlHassa region [24] with 36% with adequate knowledge."
